<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Light</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>light &lt;torch or lantern&gt;
extinguish &lt;torch or lantern&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>light lantern
hold lantern
</pre>
<p>This command lights a torch, a lantern or whatever light source you carry. A 
light only lights up the place you are in while you hold or wear it: in your 
inventory it lights nothing. Hold it in your hand (see <a cmd='#'>Help Hold</a>).
</p><p>A light burns for so many hours, and then it is used up: "It is used up, it 
won't ignite." Put it out with extinguish when you don't need it, to save it 
for later.
</p><p>Some lights are not strong enough for the darkest places, like the deepest part 
of the Haon-Dor forest: there you need a stronger one, like a lantern.
</p><p>Magic gives light too: the light spell makes the room, or something you carry, give off light, and 
magic candle, sun globe and glowing fungus make lights you can hold.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
